<title>UK: ABN Amro sets calls on Generale des Eaux.</title>
<headline>ABN Amro sets calls on Generale des Eaux.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>ABN Amro Bank N.V. has issued one million American-style call warrants, on Generales des Eaux, lead manager ABN Amro Finance S.A. said.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p>STRIKE PRICE    850 FRF		   PREMIUM	=</p>
<p>ISSUE PRICE     11.73 FRF		 GEARING	6.82 X</p>
<p>EXERCISE PERIOD 13.JUN.97-30.MAR.99   PAYDATE	13.JUN.97</p>
<p>LISTING	   PARIS		     MIN EXER LOT 1000</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
